cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use BR-MANGUE Studio, please cite the release and the accompanying article."
title: "BR-MANGUE Studio"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-21
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Desktop research software for running and inspecting the BR-MANGUE spatial
  cellular model of mangrove response to coastal sea-level change. The Studio
  provides aligned raster inputs, explicit class mapping, continuous and
  persistent-block processing, annual outputs, visual monitoring, and
  reproducible run metadata.
authors:
  - family-names: Sousa
    given-names: Felipe Martins
    affiliation: Universidade Federal do Maranhão
  - family-names: Bezerra
    given-names: Denilson da Silva
repository-code: https://github.com/oceanpep/br-mangue-studio
url: https://oceanpep.github.io/br-mangue-studio/
keywords:
  - mangrove modelling
  - cellular automaton
  - coastal change
  - sea-level rise
  - geospatial raster
  - environmental modelling
  - research software
